# Web Forge launch rules

Read **`RULEBOOK.md`** at the repo root before shipping site changes.

## Turnstile (mandatory)

Every contact form must have:

- Server: `verifyTurnstile()` in `packages/form-engine/src/handler.ts`
- Client: Turnstile widget via `public/form.js` + `<div data-turnstile />`
- Layout: `data-turnstile-site-key={process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY ?? ""}`
- CSP allows `https://challenges.cloudflare.com`
- Production env: both `NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY` and `TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY` (never test keys on prod)

## Pre-launch audit (mandatory before deploy)

1. **view-source** — save homepage + contact HTML; check Turnstile, meta, no mixed HTTP, no test keys in prod
2. **Multi-perspective review** — security, performance, SEO/a11y (separate passes or report sections)
3. **External tools** — PageSpeed, securityheaders.com, Mozilla Observatory, SSL Labs on the **live URL**

Run: `./scripts/launch-audit.sh https://www.<domain>.cz`

## Security headers

Keep `src/lib/security-headers.ts` + `poweredByHeader: false` in `next.config.ts`. Update CSP when adding third-party scripts.

## Do not launch if

- Turnstile test key in production HTML
- Security Headers grade F
- TLS/DNS still on old hosting
